<view class="tab-page"><view class="masthead"><view class="kicker">未界 / CONNECTION</view><view class="page-heading">连接申请</view><view class="deck editorial">相似的背景，不一样的故事。</view></view><view class="page-body"><view class="connect-poster"><view class="conversation-photo"><image wx:if="{{!coverFailed}}" src="/assets/editorial/conversation.jpg" mode="aspectFill" binderror="onCoverError"/><view wx:else class="state">交流主题配图暂不可用</view><text class="photo-note">图库主题配图 · 非活动现场</text></view><view class="connect-title">认识一个人，<view>听听另一种经历。</view></view><view class="connect-caption">由未界人工审核与撮合的 Peer Coffee Chat</view>
<view wx:if="{{status === 'loading'}}" class="state">正在验证身份…</view><view wx:elif="{{status === 'error'}}" class="state"><view>{{error}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="load">重试</button></view><view wx:elif="{{!identity.hasProfile}}" class="card"><view class="subtitle">先建立职业档案</view><view class="muted">连接申请需要一份最小职业画像，方便运营判断是否适合撮合。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="openOnboarding">填写职业档案</button></view><block wx:else><view class="status-pill">人工审核 · 不公开联系方式</view><button class="primary application-open" bindtap="toggleForm">{{formOpen ? '收起申请表' : '填写交流申请'}}</button><button class="secondary application-open" bindtap="openMine">查看我的申请</button><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="notice">{{message}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice">{{error}}</view>
<view wx:if="{{formOpen}}" class="application-form"><view class="subtitle">你的交流申请</view><view class="form-note">运营只会看到申请内容与最小职业摘要。提交后不会自动匹配，也不会向对方公开你的联系方式。</view><view class="label">我希望</view><view class="choice-row"><button class="choice {{form.intent === 'seek' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="seek" bindtap="selectIntent">寻找相似背景的人聊聊</button><button class="choice {{form.intent === 'share' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="share" bindtap="selectIntent">分享我的转行经历</button></view><view class="label">感兴趣方向（1–5 个）</view><view class="choice-row"><button wx:for="{{directions}}" wx:key="id" class="choice {{form.directions.indexOf(item.id) >= 0 ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleDirection">{{item.label}}</button></view><label class="label">个人背景与经历</label><textarea value="{{form.introduction}}" data-field="introduction" bindinput="input" maxlength="1500" placeholder="请写与这次交流有关的学习、工作或探索经历。"/><label class="label">希望交流的问题</label><textarea value="{{form.question}}" data-field="question" bindinput="input" maxlength="1000" placeholder="例如：我想了解临床转医疗 AI 的第一份工作如何准备。"/><label class="label">可交流时间（可选）</label><input value="{{form.availability}}" data-field="availability" bindinput="input" maxlength="300" placeholder="例如：工作日晚上或周末下午"/><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">提交给运营审核</button></view></block></view>
<view class="section-head"><view class="subtitle">一次交流，如何开始</view></view><view class="step"><text class="number">01</text><view><view class="flat-title">提交最小必要说明</view><view class="small">职业方向、背景和希望交流的问题。</view></view></view><view class="step"><text class="number">02</text><view><view class="flat-title">未界审核与撮合</view><view class="small">运营核实背景和双方交流意愿。</view></view></view><view class="step"><text class="number">03</text><view><view class="flat-title">双方确认后安排时间</view><view class="small">不是即时聊天，也不会直接公开联系方式。</view></view></view></view></view>
